{"ticker":"FLEX","updated":"2026-10-30T22:49:25Z","profile":{"longName":"Flex Ltd.","shortName":"Flex Ltd.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"United States","website":"https://www.flex.com","fullTimeEmployees":149686,"marketCap":31950940160,"trailingPE":31.107916,"forwardPE":11.038906,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.0322071,"pegRatio":0.94,"targetMeanPrice":156.5,"targetHighPrice":180.0,"targetLowPrice":128.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.248,"earningsGrowth":0.346,"grossMargins":0.09669,"operatingMargins":0.05052,"profitMargins":0.0335,"totalRevenue":30954000384,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":166.86,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":53.07,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Flex Ltd. provides technology innovation, supply chain, and manufacturing solutions to data center, communications, enterprise, consumer, automotive, healthcare, industrial, and power industries in the Americas, Asia, and Europe. The company operates through three segments: Integrated Technology Solutions (ITS), Regulated Manufacturing Solutions (RMS), and Cloud and Power Infrastructure (CPI). The ITS segment offers flexible supply and manufacturing solutions for communications, including high speed networking, enterprise, and satellite communications systems, as well as lifestyle solutions comprising products across commercial, home, and personal product categories. Its RMS segment includes industrial products, such as mission critical automation, energy, and industrial infrastructure; automotive products, including compute and power electronics platforms and integrated systems; and healthcare products comprising regulated manufacturing for medical devices, drug delivery, and equipment. The CPI segment provides cloud and cooling products, such as integrated compute systems supporting power dense digital infrastructure deployments and advanced liquid cooling solutions supporting higher density, power intensive rack architectures; and power products that include utility and facility level electrical infrastructure enabling power delivery and high density rack and board level pow","summary_zh":"Flex Ltd. 為美洲、亞洲和歐洲的資料中心、通訊、企業、消費、汽車、醫療保健、工業和電力產業提供技術創新、供應鏈和製造解決方案。該公司透過三個部門運作：整合技術解決方案（ITS）、監管製造解決方案（RMS）以及雲端和電力基礎設施（CPI）。 ITS 部門提供靈活的通訊供應和製造解決方案，包括高速網路、企業和衛星通訊系統，以及包括商業、家庭和個人產品類別產品的生活方式解決方案。其 RMS 部門包括工業產品，例如關鍵任務自動化、能源和工業基礎設施；汽車產品，包括運算和電力電子平台和整合系統；醫療保健產品，包括醫療器材、藥物傳輸和設備的受監管製造。 CPI部門提供雲端和冷卻產品，例如支援功率密集型數位基礎設施部署的整合運算系統和支援更高密度、功率密集型機架架構的先進液體冷卻解決方案；和電源產品，包括公用事業和設施級電氣基礎設施，可實現電力傳輸和高密度機架和板級電源","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電子元件","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":52.45,"h":53.68,"l":51.76,"c":53.65,"v":3131000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":53.95,"h":54.19,"l":53.48,"c":53.68,"v":3550800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":53.99,"h":55.56,"l":53.81,"c":55.17,"v":3643400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":55.52,"h":56.58,"l":54.85,"c":55.66,"v":3408800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":55.95,"h":56.85,"l":55.56,"c":55.84,"v":3031400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":55.84,"h":56.5,"l":55.35,"c":56.2,"v":3106200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":56.66,"h":58.22,"l":56.59,"c":58.05,"v":4458000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":57.59,"h":58.6,"l":57.44,"c":57.73,"v":4082700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":57.66,"h":57.88,"l":57.2,"c":57.29,"v":2259700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":57.4,"h":58.3,"l":57.37,"c":57.76,"v":2214000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":57.94,"h":57.94,"l":56.69,"c":57.2,"v":3103000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":57.2,"h":57.2,"l":55.35,"c":56.46,"v":3436600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":57.36,"h":58.24,"l":56.96,"c":58.13,"v":3164900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":58.12,"h":58.8,"l":57.69,"c":58.65,"v":7986900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":58.35,"h":59.2,"l":58.26,"c":59.01,"v":3176900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":59.06,"h":59.76,"l":58.9,"c":59.33,"v":4038100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":59.62,"h":59.62,"l":57.25,"c":57.58,"v":4550800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":55.84,"h":56.61,"l":54.5,"c":56.5,"v":5292800},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":56.65,"h":57.09,"l":56.31,"c":56.85,"v":2647800},{"t":"2